model lh05
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "Polish IKE and IKZE contribution limits for 2026: a multiple of the forecast average monthly wage for the year, but not below the amount announced for the year before (ustawa o IKE i IKZE, art. 13 and 13a)."
  note "The floor is art. 13 ust. 1a and art. 13a ust. 2: a limit below the amount announced in the previous calendar year is replaced by that amount. The rule next of limit says it."
  note "No rounding is stated in the act or the notices, so the limits are not rounded."
  note "The wage is the one stated in the budget act, or in its draft while the act isn't passed (art. 13 ust. 1, art. 13a ust. 1). The November 2025 notices predate the budget act, so they rest on the draft (druk nr 1749), which wasn't fetched: its wage is a hole row (version budget2026_draft). The asks ike_2026_notice and ikze_2026_notice are made as known on the notices' promulgation days. Later the wage is read from the minister's notice M.P. 2025 poz. 1206 and from the enacted budget act."

source budget2026 "Ustawa budżetowa na rok 2026 z dnia 9 stycznia 2026 r. (Dz. U. 2026 poz. 62)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2026/62/text.pdf"

source druk1749 "Rządowy projekt ustawy budżetowej na rok 2026, druk nr 1749 (Sejm X kadencji), not fetched" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/sejm/term10/prints/1749"

source du2008_1432 "Ustawa z dnia 6 listopada 2008 r. o zmianie ustawy o indywidualnych kontach emerytalnych oraz niektórych innych ustaw (Dz. U. 2008 nr 220 poz. 1432); art. 1 pkt 3 gives art. 13 ust. 1 its present wording" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2008/1432/text.pdf"

source du2018_2215 "Ustawa z dnia 4 października 2018 r. o pracowniczych planach kapitałowych (Dz. U. 2018 poz. 2215); art. 124 pkt 4 gives art. 13a ust. 1 and 1a their present wording" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2018/2215/text.pdf"

source mp2024_1053 "Obwieszczenie MRPiPS z dnia 10 grudnia 2024 r. w sprawie wysokości kwoty wpłat dokonywanych na indywidualne konto emerytalne w roku 2025 (M.P. 2024 poz. 1053)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/MP/2024/1053/text.pdf"

source mp2024_1055 "Obwieszczenie MRPiPS z dnia 10 grudnia 2024 r. w sprawie wysokości kwoty wpłat na indywidualne konto zabezpieczenia emerytalnego w roku 2025 (M.P. 2024 poz. 1055)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/MP/2024/1055/text.pdf"

source mp2025_1206 "Obwieszczenie MRPiPS z dnia 19 listopada 2025 r. w sprawie kwoty ograniczenia rocznej podstawy wymiaru składek w roku 2026 oraz przyjętej do jej ustalenia kwoty prognozowanego przeciętnego wynagrodzenia (M.P. 2025 poz. 1206)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/MP/2025/1206/text.pdf"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index acct = [ike, ikze, ikze_biz]

index yr = year 2025..2026

input announced[k in acct, y in yr]: money PLN

input mult[k in acct]: num

input wage[y in yr]: money PLN

def limit[k in acct, y in yr]: num PLN at start_of(y)
  rule first = ?"The 2025 limit rests on the 2025 forecast wage, which this model doesn't state." when pos(y) == 1
  rule next = max(mult[k] * wage[y], announced[k, y - 1]) when pos(y) > 1

ask ike_2026: limit[ike, 2026] law 2026-10-18

ask ike_2026_notice: limit[ike, 2026] law 2025-11-24 as known 2025-11-24

ask ikze_2026: limit[ikze, 2026] law 2026-10-18

ask ikze_2026_notice: limit[ikze, 2026], limit[ikze_biz, 2026] law 2025-11-18 as known 2025-11-18

ask ikze_biz_2026: limit[ikze_biz, 2026] law 2026-10-18

version ikeact_2008_1432
  cite du2008_1432
  governs always
  known 2008-12-12
  note "Law is known from the promulgation of the act that enacted the row (LANGUAGE §4.5): Dz. U. 2008 nr 220 poz. 1432, promulgated 12 December 2008 (ELI DU/2008/1432). Art. 1 pkt 3 gave art. 13 ust. 1 its present wording, with the threefold multiple. The row is read in the tekst jednolity Dz. U. z 2024 r. poz. 707 (same in Dz. U. z 2026 r. poz. 91), which restates it and isn't a version of it (LANGUAGE §5.3)."
  mult[ike] = 3 "art. 1 pkt 3 (art. 13 ust. 1, tekst jednolity Dz. U. z 2024 r. poz. 707): trzykrotności przeciętnego prognozowanego wynagrodzenia miesięcznego"

version ikeact_2018_2215
  cite du2018_2215
  governs always
  known 2018-11-28
  note "Dz. U. 2018 poz. 2215, promulgated 28 November 2018 (ELI DU/2018/2215). Art. 124 pkt 4 gave art. 13a ust. 1 its present wording and added ust. 1a; the act puts the amendment that added ust. 1a in force on 1 January 2021, so its row governs from 2021. The 1,2 multiple itself dates from Dz. U. 2013 poz. 1717; the row is known from the act whose wording it is read in. Both rows are read in the tekst jednolity Dz. U. z 2024 r. poz. 707."
  mult[ikze] = 1.2 "art. 124 pkt 4 (art. 13a ust. 1, tekst jednolity Dz. U. z 2024 r. poz. 707): 1,2-krotności przeciętnego prognozowanego wynagrodzenia miesięcznego"
  mult[ikze_biz] = 1.8 governs 2021.. "art. 124 pkt 4 (art. 13a ust. 1a, tekst jednolity Dz. U. z 2024 r. poz. 707): 1,8-krotności przeciętnego prognozowanego wynagrodzenia miesięcznego"

version mp2024_1053_ike
  cite mp2024_1053
  governs always
  known 2024-12-11
  note "Promulgated 11 December 2024 (ELI MP/2024/1053)."
  announced[ike, 2025] = 26019 "single paragraph: w roku 2025 wynosi 26 019 zł"

version mp2024_1055_ikze
  cite mp2024_1055
  governs always
  known 2024-12-12
  note "Promulgated 12 December 2024 (ELI MP/2024/1055)."
  announced[ikze, 2025] = 10407.6 "pkt 1, art. 13a ust. 1: w roku 2025 wynosi 10 407,60 zł"
  announced[ikze_biz, 2025] = 15611.4 "pkt 2, art. 13a ust. 1a: w roku 2025 wynosi 15 611,40 zł"

version budget2026_draft
  cite druk1749
  governs always
  known 2025-09-30
  note "The Council of Ministers' draft budget for 2026, Sejm print 1749: its documentDate and deliveryDate in the Sejm API (api.sejm.gov.pl/sejm/term10/prints/1749) are both 30 September 2025. A draft isn't promulgated, so it is known from the day it was delivered to the Sejm and made public (LANGUAGE §4.5)."
  note "Art. 13 ust. 1 and art. 13a ust. 1 read the wage 'określonego w ustawie budżetowej lub ustawie o prowizorium budżetowym lub w ich projektach, jeżeli odpowiednie ustawy nie zostały uchwalone'. The enacted act's row (budget2026_art24) is known later, so it wins from its known date (LANGUAGE §4.6)."
  wage[2026] = ?"What forecast average monthly wage for 2026 does the draft budget (druk nr 1749) state? The case didn't fetch it." "druk nr 1749, the article on the forecast average monthly wage"

version mp2025_1206_wage
  cite mp2025_1206
  governs always
  known 2025-11-25
  note "Warszawa, dnia 25 listopada 2025 r., Poz. 1206. The wage is stated for the social-insurance cap; the IKE and IKZE notices don't say which wage they used."
  replace wage[2026] = 9420 "single paragraph: przyjęta do jej ustalenia kwota prognozowanego przeciętnego wynagrodzenia wynosi 9420 zł"

version budget2026_art24
  cite budget2026
  governs always
  known 2026-01-20
  note "Passed on 9 January 2026 and promulgated on 20 January 2026 (Dz. U. 2026 poz. 62, ELI DU/2026/62); law is known from its promulgation (LANGUAGE §4.5)."
  replace wage[2026] = 9420 "art. 24 (PDF p. 4): Prognozowane przeciętne miesięczne wynagrodzenie brutto w gospodarce narodowej wynosi 9 420 zł"
